title: <span class="generalitat-coalition" data-parties="erc [+ parlament_current_icv +][? if cup_broad_kind = 'popular_unity':  cup?][? if cup_broad_kind = 'new_popular_front' or cup_broad_kind = 'minority_left_tripartite':  psc?]" data-summary="Cabinet seats - [+ parlament_coalition_cabinet_seats +]/[+ parlament_s_majority +]">[? if cup_broad_kind = "republican": Republican Government?][? if cup_broad_kind = "popular_unity": Popular Unity Coalition?][? if cup_broad_kind = "new_popular_front": New Popular Front?][? if cup_broad_kind = "minority_left_tripartite": Minority Left Tripartite?]</span> negotiations
subtitle: [? if cup_broad_coalition_phase = 1: The parties have opened the first round of negotiations.?][? if cup_broad_coalition_phase = 2: The parties have returned for a second round with a revised proposal.?][? if cup_broad_coalition_phase = 3: This is the third and final round of negotiations.?]
tags: event
role: event
new-page: true
view-if: cup_broad_coalition_phase > 0
on-arrival: {!
    Q.parlament_coalition_changes = false;
    Q.parlament_coalition_concessions = false;
    Q.parlament_coalition_concessions_social = 0;
    Q.parlament_coalition_concessions_indy = 0;
    Q.parlament_coalition_proposal_president = Q.parlament_coalition_leader;
    Q.parlament_coalition_proposal_vp = Q.parlament_coalition_leader;
    Q.parlament_coalition_proposal_interior = Q.parlament_coalition_leader;
    Q.parlament_coalition_proposal_economy = Q.parlament_coalition_leader;
    Q.parlament_coalition_proposal_foreign = Q.parlament_coalition_leader;
    Q.parlament_coalition_proposal_health = Q.parlament_coalition_leader;
    Q.parlament_coalition_proposal_education = Q.parlament_coalition_leader;
    Q.parlament_coalition_proposal_territory = Q.parlament_coalition_leader;
    Q.parlament_coalition_proposal_bnl = Q.parlament_coalition_leader;

    var partners = ["erc", Q.parlament_current_icv];
    if (Q.cup_broad_kind == "popular_unity") {
        partners.push("cup");
    }
    if (Q.cup_broad_kind == "new_popular_front" || Q.cup_broad_kind == "minority_left_tripartite") {
        partners.push("psc");
    }
    var costs = { interior: 10, economy: 10, foreign: 6, health: 7, education: 7, territory: 5, bnl: 5 };
    var prefs = {
        erc: ["foreign", "bnl", "health", "interior", "economy", "education", "territory"],
        cup: ["interior", "bnl", "territory", "education", "health", "economy", "foreign"],
        psc: ["interior", "economy", "health", "education", "bnl", "territory", "foreign"]
    };
    prefs[Q.parlament_current_icv] = ["education", "territory", "bnl", "health", "economy", "interior", "foreign"];
    for (var i = 0; i < partners.length; i++) {
        var party = partners[i];
        if (party == Q.parlament_coalition_leader) {
            continue;
        }
        var leverage = Q[party + "_parlament_s"] * 55 / Math.max(1, Q.parlament_coalition_cabinet_seats);
        var order = prefs[party];
        for (var j = 0; j < order.length; j++) {
            var office = order[j];
            if (leverage >= costs[office]) {
                Q["parlament_coalition_proposal_" + office] = party;
                leverage -= costs[office];
            }
        }
    }
    var largestFollower = partners[0] == Q.parlament_coalition_leader ? partners[1] : partners[0];
    for (var k = 0; k < partners.length; k++) {
        if (partners[k] != Q.parlament_coalition_leader && Q[partners[k] + "_parlament_s"] > Q[largestFollower + "_parlament_s"]) {
            largestFollower = partners[k];
        }
    }
    Q.parlament_coalition_proposal_vp = largestFollower;
    Q.parlament_coalition_leverage = Math.max(10, Q[Q.player_party + "_parlament_s"] * 55 / Math.max(1, Q.parlament_coalition_cabinet_seats)) + (Q.cup_broad_coalition_phase - 1) * 4;
    if (Q.speaker_party == Q.player_party) {
        Q.parlament_coalition_leverage -= 10;
    }
!}
go-to: phase_text

@phase_text
new-page: true
go-to: parlament_coalition_setnames
set-jump: choices

The negotiating teams have presented a cabinet proposal.

@choices

[? if parlament_coalition_concessions_social: **Social commitment:** [+ parlament_coalition_concessions_social_text +]?]

- @ministries
- @social
- @indy
- @push
- @send
- @accept

@ministries
title: Propose an alternative Government Composition
view-if: player_party = "erc" or (player_party = "cup" and cup_broad_kind = "popular_unity")

- @interior
- @bnl
- @territory
- @education
- @health
- @economy
- @foreign
- @phase_text: Finish proposing changes

@interior
title: [? if parlament_coalition_proposal_interior != player_party: Demand the Interior Ministry?][? if parlament_coalition_proposal_interior = player_party: Give up the Interior Ministry?]
choose-if: parlament_coalition_proposal_interior = player_party or parlament_coalition_leverage >= 10
unavailable-subtitle: We lack enough leverage to demand the Interior Ministry.
on-arrival: {!
    var taking = Q.parlament_coalition_proposal_interior != Q.player_party;
    Q.parlament_coalition_changes = true;
    Q.parlament_coalition_proposal_interior = taking ? Q.player_party : Q.parlament_coalition_leader;
    Q.parlament_coalition_leverage += taking ? -10 : 10;
!}
go-to: ministries

@bnl
title: [? if parlament_coalition_proposal_bnl != player_party: Demand the Business & Labour Ministry?][? if parlament_coalition_proposal_bnl = player_party: Give up the Business & Labour Ministry?]
choose-if: parlament_coalition_proposal_bnl = player_party or parlament_coalition_leverage >= 5
unavailable-subtitle: We lack enough leverage to demand the Business & Labour Ministry.
on-arrival: {!
    var taking = Q.parlament_coalition_proposal_bnl != Q.player_party;
    Q.parlament_coalition_changes = true;
    Q.parlament_coalition_proposal_bnl = taking ? Q.player_party : Q.parlament_coalition_leader;
    Q.parlament_coalition_leverage += taking ? -5 : 5;
!}
go-to: ministries

@territory
title: [? if parlament_coalition_proposal_territory != player_party: Demand the Territory Ministry?][? if parlament_coalition_proposal_territory = player_party: Give up the Territory Ministry?]
choose-if: parlament_coalition_proposal_territory = player_party or parlament_coalition_leverage >= 5
unavailable-subtitle: We lack enough leverage to demand the Territory Ministry.
on-arrival: {!
    var taking = Q.parlament_coalition_proposal_territory != Q.player_party;
    Q.parlament_coalition_changes = true;
    Q.parlament_coalition_proposal_territory = taking ? Q.player_party : Q.parlament_coalition_leader;
    Q.parlament_coalition_leverage += taking ? -5 : 5;
!}
go-to: ministries

@education
title: [? if parlament_coalition_proposal_education != player_party: Demand the Education Ministry?][? if parlament_coalition_proposal_education = player_party: Give up the Education Ministry?]
choose-if: parlament_coalition_proposal_education = player_party or parlament_coalition_leverage >= 7
unavailable-subtitle: We lack enough leverage to demand the Education Ministry.
on-arrival: {!
    var taking = Q.parlament_coalition_proposal_education != Q.player_party;
    Q.parlament_coalition_changes = true;
    Q.parlament_coalition_proposal_education = taking ? Q.player_party : Q.parlament_coalition_leader;
    Q.parlament_coalition_leverage += taking ? -7 : 7;
!}
go-to: ministries

@health
title: [? if parlament_coalition_proposal_health != player_party: Demand the Health Ministry?][? if parlament_coalition_proposal_health = player_party: Give up the Health Ministry?]
choose-if: parlament_coalition_proposal_health = player_party or parlament_coalition_leverage >= 7
unavailable-subtitle: We lack enough leverage to demand the Health Ministry.
on-arrival: {!
    var taking = Q.parlament_coalition_proposal_health != Q.player_party;
    Q.parlament_coalition_changes = true;
    Q.parlament_coalition_proposal_health = taking ? Q.player_party : Q.parlament_coalition_leader;
    Q.parlament_coalition_leverage += taking ? -7 : 7;
!}
go-to: ministries

@economy
title: [? if parlament_coalition_proposal_economy != player_party: Demand the Economy Ministry?][? if parlament_coalition_proposal_economy = player_party: Give up the Economy Ministry?]
choose-if: parlament_coalition_proposal_economy = player_party or parlament_coalition_leverage >= 10
unavailable-subtitle: We lack enough leverage to demand the Economy Ministry.
on-arrival: {!
    var taking = Q.parlament_coalition_proposal_economy != Q.player_party;
    Q.parlament_coalition_changes = true;
    Q.parlament_coalition_proposal_economy = taking ? Q.player_party : Q.parlament_coalition_leader;
    Q.parlament_coalition_leverage += taking ? -10 : 10;
!}
go-to: ministries

@foreign
title: [? if parlament_coalition_proposal_foreign != player_party: Demand the Foreign Affairs Ministry?][? if parlament_coalition_proposal_foreign = player_party: Give up the Foreign Affairs Ministry?]
choose-if: parlament_coalition_proposal_foreign = player_party or parlament_coalition_leverage >= 6
unavailable-subtitle: We lack enough leverage to demand the Foreign Affairs Ministry.
on-arrival: {!
    var taking = Q.parlament_coalition_proposal_foreign != Q.player_party;
    Q.parlament_coalition_changes = true;
    Q.parlament_coalition_proposal_foreign = taking ? Q.player_party : Q.parlament_coalition_leader;
    Q.parlament_coalition_leverage += taking ? -6 : 6;
!}
go-to: ministries

@social
title: Add a social-policy commitment
choose-if: parlament_coalition_concessions_social = 0 and parlament_coalition_leverage >= 5
unavailable-subtitle: [? if parlament_coalition_concessions_social: The commitment is already included.?][? if parlament_coalition_leverage < 5: We lack enough leverage.?]
on-arrival: {!
    Q.parlament_coalition_changes = true;
    Q.parlament_coalition_concessions = true;
    Q.parlament_coalition_concessions_social = 1;
    Q.parlament_coalition_concessions_social_text = "The cabinet commits to reverse austerity and expand social spending.";
    Q.parlament_coalition_leverage -= 5;
!}
go-to: phase_text

@indy
title: Add a stronger independence commitment
choose-if: erc_roadmap < 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if cup_broad_kind = "new_popular_front" or cup_broad_kind = "minority_left_tripartite": The PSC will not accept a stronger independence commitment in this cabinet.?][? if cup_broad_kind = "republican" or cup_broad_kind = "popular_unity": The current [+ parlament_current_icv +] leadership will not accept an independence demand beyond the roadmap already agreed.?]
go-to: phase_text

@push
title: Push for more leverage
choose-if: parlament_coalition_push < cup_broad_coalition_phase and cup_broad_coalition_phase < 3
unavailable-subtitle: We cannot push any further this round.
on-arrival: {!
    Q.parlament_coalition_push += 1;
    Q.parlament_coalition_leverage += 4;
    Q.cup_relations -= Q.cup_broad_coalition_phase == 1 ? 4 : 2;
    Q[Q.parlament_current_icv + "_relations"] -= 2;
!}
go-to: phase_text

@send
title: Send the counter-proposal
view-if: parlament_coalition_changes
on-arrival: {!
    Q.parlament_coalition_proposal_accept = Q.parlament_coalition_push < Q.cup_broad_coalition_phase;
!}
go-to: accepted if parlament_coalition_proposal_accept; next_phase if not parlament_coalition_proposal_accept

@accept
title: Accept the current proposal
choose-if: not parlament_coalition_changes
unavailable-subtitle: Our changes require the other parties' approval first.
go-to: accepted

@accepted
on-arrival: {!
    Q.cup_broad_coalition_phase = 0;
    if (Q.cup_broad_kind == "republican") {
        Q.cat_coalition = ["erc", Q.parlament_current_icv];
    }
    if (Q.cup_broad_kind == "popular_unity" && Q.parlament_coalition_leader == "erc") {
        Q.cat_coalition = ["erc", Q.parlament_current_icv, "cup"];
    }
    if (Q.cup_broad_kind == "popular_unity" && Q.parlament_coalition_leader == Q.parlament_current_icv) {
        Q.cat_coalition = [Q.parlament_current_icv, "erc", "cup"];
    }
    if (Q.cup_broad_kind == "popular_unity" && Q.parlament_coalition_leader == "cup") {
        Q.cat_coalition = ["cup", "erc", Q.parlament_current_icv];
    }
    if (Q.cup_broad_kind == "new_popular_front" || Q.cup_broad_kind == "minority_left_tripartite") {
        Q.cat_coalition = ["erc", "psc", Q.parlament_current_icv];
    }
    Q.cat_coalition_support = (Q.cup_broad_kind == "republican" || Q.cup_broad_kind == "new_popular_front") ? ["cup"] : [];
    Q.cat_coalition_abstain = Q.cup_broad_kind == "minority_left_tripartite" ? ["cup"] : [];
    var label = Q.cup_broad_kind == "republican" ? "Republican Government" : (Q.cup_broad_kind == "popular_unity" ? "Popular Unity Coalition" : (Q.cup_broad_kind == "new_popular_front" ? "New Popular Front" : "Minority Left Tripartite"));
    var summary = (Q.cup_broad_kind == "minority_left_tripartite" ? "Minority government" : "Invested government") + " - " + Q.parlament_coalition_support_seats + "/" + Q.parlament_s_majority;
    Q.cat_coalition_disp = G.governmentTooltip("generalitat", Q.cat_coalition, summary, "<span style='color: var(--erc); font-style: italic;'>" + label + "</span>");
    Q.erc_in_gob = true;
    Q.erc_supporting = true;
    Q.cup_in_gob = Q.cup_broad_kind == "popular_unity";
    Q.cup_supporting = Q.cup_broad_kind != "minority_left_tripartite";
    Q.cat_coalition_dissent = 0;
    Q.position_disp = Q.player_party == "cup" && !Q.cup_in_gob ? (Q.cup_supporting ? "<span style='font-style: italic'>Government Support</span>" : "<span style='font-style: italic'>Opposition</span>") : "Generalitat";
!}

The parties have completed their agreement and will install a [+ cat_coalition_disp +]. [? if cup_broad_kind = "republican" or cup_broad_kind = "new_popular_front": CUP will support it from outside government.?][? if cup_broad_kind = "minority_left_tripartite": CUP will abstain, but remains in opposition.?]

- @parlament_coalition_resolve: A new government is formed

@next_phase
go-to: new_elections if cup_broad_coalition_phase >= 3; wait if cup_broad_coalition_phase < 3

@wait
on-arrival: {!
    Q.cup_broad_coalition_phase += 1;
    Q.month_actions += 1;
    Q.social_dissent += 2;
!}

The parties will require another round of talks.

- @post_event: And so, time passes...

@new_elections
on-arrival: {!
    Q.parlament_repeat_election = true;
    Q.cup_broad_coalition_phase = 0;
    Q.cup_relations -= 5;
    Q[Q.parlament_current_icv + "_relations"] -= 3;
    Q.snap_blame = Q.player_party;
    Q.snap_counterparty = "cup";
    Q.snap_severity = 0.12;
!}
call: snap_election

After all these negotiation rounds, the negotiations for a broad-left government  have failed. New elections will have to be the ones to decide the matter.

- @post_event
